  "article": [
    {
      "level": 2,
      "heading": "Discussion",
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "text": "Call this endpoint to configure the URLs for your `Get Retention Message` endpoints in the sandbox and production environments. For more information, including endpoint specifications and server requirements, see `setting-up-retention-messaging-endpoint`.",
          "refs": [
            "doc://com.apple.retentionmessaging/documentation/RetentionMessaging/setting-up-retention-messaging-endpoint"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "> **Note**\n>\n>  Your server needs to pass a performance test before you can configure your `Get Retention Message` endpoint for the production environment. For more information, see `Initiate-Performance-Test`.",
          "refs": [
            "doc://com.apple.retentionmessaging/documentation/RetentionMessaging/Initiate-Performance-Test"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "As a best practice, use different URLs for the sandbox and production environments.",
          "refs": []
        }
      ],
      "listItems": []
    },
    {
      "level": 3,
      "heading": "Configure your URL for the sandbox environment",
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "text": "To configure your `Get Retention Message` endpoint for the sandbox environment, call `Configure-Realtime-URL` using its sandbox URL. Provide your endpoint’s sandbox URL.",
          "refs": [
            "doc://com.apple.retentionmessaging/documentation/RetentionMessaging/Configure-Realtime-URL"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "listItems": []
    },
    {
      "level": 3,
      "heading": "Configure your URL for the production environment",
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "text": "To configure your `Get Retention Message` endpoint for the production environment, first configure your `Get Retention Message` endpoint for the sandbox environment, then:",
          "refs": []
        }
      ],
      "listItems": [
        {
          "text": "Call `Initiate-Performance-Test` to test your endpoint in the sandbox environment.",
          "refs": [
            "doc://com.apple.retentionmessaging/documentation/RetentionMessaging/Initiate-Performance-Test"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Call `Get-Performance-Test-Results` and ensure your server passes the performance test.",
          "refs": [
            "doc://com.apple.retentionmessaging/documentation/RetentionMessaging/Get-Performance-Test-Results"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To configure your `Get Retention Message` endpoint for the production environment, call `Configure-Realtime-URL` using its production URL. Provide your endpoint’s production URL.",
          "refs": [
            "doc://com.apple.retentionmessaging/documentation/RetentionMessaging/Configure-Realtime-URL"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "level": 3,
      "heading": "Change your endpoint’s URL",
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "text": "To change your endpoint’s URL, just call `Configure-Realtime-URL` again. The Retention Messaging API uses your most recent successful configuration. To check the URL you set, call `Get-Realtime-URL`.",
          "refs": [
            "doc://com.apple.retentionmessaging/documentation/RetentionMessaging/Configure-Realtime-URL",
            "doc://com.apple.retentionmessaging/documentation/RetentionMessaging/Get-Realtime-URL"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To delete—or deconfigure—your endpoint’s URL entirely, call `Delete-Realtime-URL`.",
          "refs": [
            "doc://com.apple.retentionmessaging/documentation/RetentionMessaging/Delete-Realtime-URL"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "listItems": []
    }
  ],
